          "name": "Operation",
          "type": "TFunctionRef<bool ( FVerseFunctionDescriptor )>"
        },
        {
          "name": "Iteration Flags",
          "type": "EFieldIterationFlags",
          "default": "EFieldIterationFlags::None"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Iterates over Verse Function Properties on an object instance and executes a callback with VerseFunction value and its Verse name.\n@param Object Object instance to iterate Verse Functions for\n@param Operation callback for each of the found Verse Functions. When the callback returns false, iteration is stopped.\n@param IterationFlags Additional options used when iterating over Verse Function properties"
